## Instructions

1. Update "last_startup_md_read" when you read .claude/STARTUP.md
2. Update "last_claude_md_read" when you read .claude/CLAUDE.md
3. Update "Active Task" when starting work
4. Update "Gate Status" as you pass each gate
5. Record any warnings, errors, or blockers
6. Update "Test Results" after running tests
7. Track breaking changes immediately

This file helps maintain continuity across context resets.

