## Current Project State

**Phase 1: Multi-Language Foundation (i18n)** - ✅ COMPLETE (100%)
- Database schema with 6 i18n tables
- AI-powered translation service (Ollama)
- Translation Management Dashboard
- 10 languages supported (English, Chinese Simplified/Traditional, Spanish, Portuguese, Arabic, Vietnamese, Hindi, Tamil, Telugu)
- 3 languages fully translated (English, Spanish, Chinese Simplified)
